<title>KUWAIT: Burgan Bank to auction 20.8 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Burgan Bank to auction 20.8 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait's Burgan Bank will auction 20.79 million shares belonging to investors who failed to pay for the shares, the Kuwait Stock Exchange said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The auction on Monday will use the closing price of that day as a starting price, said the exchange.</p>
<p>There is a total of 743.4 million Burgan shares, 51 percent of which are owned by the state.</p>
<p>Burgan shares closed at 0.305 dinars ($1.02) on Saturday.</p>
</text>
